    "en": {
      "text": "Dealing damage or scoring kills increments continuously scales up stat bonuses. Stacks displayed on-screen are only visual aides, the buff ramps up continuously.\n\nMaximum effect is displayed as x5 Willing Vessel. Stat bonuses constantly decrease by 2.2?% of the maximum bonus per second?.\n\nStat bonuses when the visual stack display reaches 1|2|3|4|5 stacks:\n• ?|?|?|?|20? Stability\n• ?|?|?|?|30? Handling\n• 2?|5|10|25|30 Reload Speed\n• ?|?|?|?|15% decreased Draw/Charge Time\n• 20|40|50|70|80 Charge Rate (Swords)",
